abstract: >-
  A camera-first, uncertainty-aware AI nutrition journal with local longitudinal
  records, deterministic diet scoring, privacy controls and managed-gateway
  foundations. Created and product-led by LAI ZEYU (来泽宇) using an
  AI-assisted vibe-coding workflow.
